{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53133","headline":"剑诗 · 卢纶","name":"剑诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太平时节无人看，雪刃闲封满匣尘。\n（见《吟窗杂录》卷十四《诗中旨格》）（按：《吟窗杂录》本作者名作「处纶」，兹依《诗学指南》卷四改正。\n《全唐诗》卷八四九收作处默诗，疑误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}